<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 18.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 18.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixingrates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Feb 18	Feb 17     Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  266.540     265.070     247.020    7.90 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  304.070     304.100     306.830   -0.90 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.530     156.430     158.970   -1.53 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.386	46.350	47.182   -1.69 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  428.220     429.720     419.180    2.16 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.450     139.360     141.685   -1.58 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.834	15.862	16.185   -2.17 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  214.650     213.590     212.430    1.05 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.853	 1.850	 1.888   -1.85 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.557	 1.560	 1.581   -1.52 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  179.795     179.500     183.135   -1.82 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
